    },
    "Barosense built this report on the device, from entries a person made about themselves. It sets out what they recorded, not measurements of their health. It is not a diagnosis and not medical advice, and it does not replace talking to a doctor." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Barosense built this report on the device, from entries a person made about themselves. It sets out what they recorded, not measurements of their health. It is not a diagnosis and not medical advice, and it does not replace talking to a doctor."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Barosense сформував цей звіт на пристрої з записів, які людина робила про себе сама. Це виклад того, що вона записувала, а не вимірювання стану її здоров'я. Це не діагноз і не медична порада, і він не замінює розмову з лікарем."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Barosense can ask how you're feeling at the time of day you already tend to check in." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Barosense can ask how you're feeling at the time of day you already tend to check in."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Barosense може питати, як ти почуваєшся, — у той час, коли ти зазвичай робиш чек-ін."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Barosense can read only part of your Health data. Open Health to check what it may read." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Barosense can read only part of your Health data. Open Health to check what it may read."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Barosense зчитує з Health лише частину даних. Відкрий Health, щоб перевірити доступ."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Barosense can use Apple Weather to extend the pressure chart past today. Your phone measures what the pressure is now; Apple Weather is what lets the chart carry on into the next few days." : {
      "comment" : "A paragraph of text that describes the pressure",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Barosense може використовувати Apple Weather, щоб продовжити графік тиску далі за сьогодні. Твій телефон вимірює, який тиск зараз; Apple Weather — це те, завдяки чому графік тягнеться на кілька днів уперед."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Barosense can't open its data" : {
